 which is to carry out the subtraction in the reverse order:\n\n$$\n5.8-3=2.8\n$$\n\nHowever, since our answer must be negative, we need to change the sign of the answer above. \n\nTherefore, we conclude that\n\n$$\n3-5.8=-2.8\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186493907 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186179814 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "778ae1c8-c651-56f1-ab58-1817d3fe4bb9" :knowledge-point/title "Subtracting Positive Decimals From Decimals With Unequal Numbers of Decimals"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2862e84e-f462-5032-8dfa-808b3125fdc2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-1.3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186493456} {:answer/id #uuid "41078b77-96a0-5f7c-bb94-1be5ec73d85e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2.3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186493502} {:answer/id #uuid "823212ce-1cfb-5c75-bb92-ea01b8f7d8f0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-1.7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186493597} {:answer/id #uuid "b7bebb8b-c4ab-5271-bbaa-eee64c1d8059" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2.7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186493689} {:answer/id #uuid "de59e0c6-68e6-5941-9e8b-b9a2293c2c62" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-14.7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186493741}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "b7bebb8b-c4ab-5271-bbaa-eee64c1d8059" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2.7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186493689} :answer-field/id #uuid "256bfffe-3c5a-55f0-9609-ab2ee806e2e9" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186493810}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "2d4d7236-1971-52db-b086-a77353f5fe00" :question/math-academy-id "q-128150" :question/problem "$6-8.7=$" :question/worked-solution "Since $8.7$ is larger than $6,$ the answer will be negative.\n\nWe start by solving an easier problem, which is to carry out the subtraction in the reverse order:\n\n$$\n8.7-6=2.7\n$$\n\nHowever, since our answer must be negative, we need to change the sign of the answer above. \n\nTherefore, we conclude that\n\n$$\n6-8.7=-2.7\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186493935 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186179813 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "507d4d46-699c-5b4f-a010-66aec6abef67" :knowledge-point/title "Subtracting Positive Decimals From Decimals"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "f51a08b5-544d-56bf-b524-00c4e402e1fe" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-5.9" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186493786}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "f51a08b5-544d-56bf-b524-00c4e402e1fe" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-5.9" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186493786} :answer-field/id #uuid "89d68d1f-65d8-579a-bcd1-d6d181a6133c" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186493844}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "8f920e3a-0555-530e-885c-0505096145f6" :question/math-academy-id "q-186102" :question/problem "$-3.6-2.3=${{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "The answer will be negative since $-3.6$ is negative, and we're subtracting $2.3$ from it.\n\nWe start by solving an easier problem, which is to add their absolute values:\n\n$$\n3.6+2.3=5.9\n$$\n\nHowever, since our answer must be negative, we need to change the sign of the answer above. \n\nTherefore, we conclude that\n\n$$\n-3.6-2.3=-5.9.\n$$"}]}
